  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Combine cantaloupe, water, evaporated milk, and sugar in a large pitcher, stirring until sugar dissolves; refrigerate for 10 minutes. Divide cantaloupe mixture among 20 molds; freeze until firm, about 6 hours.",
